py is intensifying, after the AI chipmaking firm has been hit with a shareh=
older lawsuit.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">According to a complaint filed in federal =
court in San Jose, =E2=80=8BCalifornia, the defendants misled shareholders =
about Huang=E2=80=99s alleged =E2=80=8Baffair with Alice Huang, a former ex=
ecutive of Singapore-based =E2=81=A0Megaspeed, and did =E2=80=8Bnot disclos=
e that the matter raised national security concerns that =E2=80=8Bthreatene=
d Nvidia=E2=80=99s reputation and business prospects.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The suit also claims that Huang=E2=80=99s =
failure to disclose the affair artificially inflated Nvidia=E2=80=99s share=
 price, and could have violated federal securities laws, Politico reported.=
</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Nvidia=E2=80=99s share price took a knock =
yesterday =E2=80=93 falling by 3.2% and cutting the company=E2=80=99s valua=
tion by almost $200bn, to $4.3tn.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Huang=E2=80=99s reputation has taken a ser=
ious knock, after he admitted being unfaithful to his wife after reports of=
 an affair with Nvidia customer and alleged Chinese spy Alice Huang.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As Megaspeed has been accused of illicitly=
 smuggling and diverting restricted Nvidia chips to China, the ramification=
s are serious.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Donald Trump weighed in over the scandal o=
n Monday, telling reporters: =E2=80=9CI asked him [Mr Huang] about that and=
 he said he had absolutely no idea that the person in question was a spy.=
=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Trump also told a news conference that the=
 US Federal Bureau of Investigation was involved in the case, saying: =E2=
=80=9CWe=E2=80=99ll look into it. I know the FBI is looking into it in term=
s of something else.=E2=80=9D</p>
